      "reason": "Output paths are checked before output/config-dependent materialization, reject absolute/parent/reserved/source collisions, and additional reports must be declared by a config read from pinned Git. The unchanged original absolute-path harness now raises ValueError Unsafe capture path; its own sentinel remains exactly DO NOT CHANGE. Declared output slots and destinations are checked within the private roots.",
