      ],
      "mechanism": "read_inventory plus resolve_snapshot_read records the logical alias and selects its canonical target file. materialize_directory_links creates the pinned alias in both roots. verify_prepared_inputs checks selected canonical file bytes, but never compares receipt.directorySymlinks with the physical aliases. Repointing cases/alias from real to other changes the producer read without changing either selected canonical file.",
      "actualObservation": {
