  "remainingIntegrationBoundaries": [
    "Capture integrity is distinct from full original/candidate native QA and its lane-specific read/identity adapters.",
    "Successful absolute-path strace reads do not alone prove complete directory discovery, relative or file-descriptor read closure.",
    "The launcher starts from a read-only host filesystem, masks the chosen worktree and uses private writable run state; it is not a general confidential-host sandbox.",
    "Installed dependency bytes have an externally accepted content-tree pin plus the Git lock binding; this does not prove all host executables, libraries or environment inputs pinned.",
    "Large private capture needs a separately measured current resource budget and exact snapshot/toolchain/input pins. No large capture was created in this review.",
